{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hi, I'm a indie single developer, I hope you enjoy your game.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u200bEva Platformer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game description:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the game Eva Platformer! In this game you will take on the role of the heroine Eva, who goes on an exciting journey through bright and colorful worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is to collect coins and keys to open new levels and overcome various obstacles on the way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176450/extras/eva4.gif?t=1744447771\" /><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collecting Coins: Each level has dozens of gold coins waiting for you to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finding Keys: Keys are the main element needed to pass the game. You can use them to open doors to the next location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Levels: The game features several different levels, each offering unique locations.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obstacles and enemies: On Eva's path you will encounter enemies. Use jump and attack to destroy them and reach the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176450/extras/eva3.gif?t=1744447771\" /><strong>Help Eva collect all the coins and keys to open the door to an exciting world of adventure! Join Eva Platformer game and prove that you are a real platformer lover!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176450/extras/dgfdfdfdfdf.gif?t=1744447771\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepageba